[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_02_0010","text":"嗯……先找手电筒──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_02_0020","text":"好痛……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_02_0030","text":"唔……！\nProducer先生……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_02_0040","text":"啊，没事\n只是撞了一下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_02_0050","text":"这点小事没什么大不──\n啊──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_02_0060","text":"凛世，看窗外……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_02_0070","text":"……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_02_0080","text":"啊…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_02_0090","text":"哈哈，好美的星空啊\n……要不是停电，还真注意不到呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_02_0100","text":"──是的……\n好美……非常……"}]
